'''Ranma Saotome (M)''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 596
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Ranma Saotome (M)
|name2 = Ranma Saotome (F)
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ranma Saotome (F)''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Ranma Saotome (M) has [[Massive Damage]] against Red and Floating enemies, so they can chip away at Floating and Red enemies with a spike-like attack which, thanks to Multi-Hit, can be very effective at fending off enemies such as [[Brollow]]. Their [[Omni Strike]] can't hit far in the backline, due to it only having 75 piercing range, but it can ensure the attack hits melee enemies all in the group, as well as lowering the chance of Multi-hit making them miss.

Ranma Saotome also has Slow Immune or Freeze Immune depending on the form (Slow immune in first form and Freeze immune in second). This is to counter enemies such as [[Henry]] and [[Croakley]], but unfortunately, those enemies are traitless, so they aren't effected by the Massive Damage, but he's still useful in Henry/Croakley levels where there is also Red or Floating enemies. However, Ranma has one major con that drags them down far: they have low base DPS. Only around 5k DPS for 325 range, which is very low. Even their effective DPS of 15k-20k is quite low for a massive damage unit.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Midranger}}

